@ [canonical_uuid] 43ef2537-0fdf-4798-9f5e-8e8a3b5210e9

& [Request]
  + exact lineage source canonical signature custody verifier implementation bookend proof branch remote proposal identity and principal-role-subject request
  + unresolved authorities are policy_governance key_custody revocation_truth current_time live_decision fresh_observation private_execution_permit broker_projection physical_preparation
  + maximum attempts one retry zero cleanup zero fixture_only true and self-digest

& [Roles]
  + operator_principal policy_governor key_custodian revocation_authority time_witness observation_acquirer permit_issuer broker_executor
  + roles are ordered unique and cannot substitute for each other

& [Stages]
  + C1 policy governance C2 public-key custody C3 revocation C4 time C5 live decision C6 correspondence verification C7 fresh observation C8 private permit C9 broker projection admission
  + every stage has exact predecessor coordinates role input descriptors output descriptors and authority transition vectors
  + C6 can produce cryptographic correspondence only; no stage is executed by this plan

& [Receipt]
  + status operator_authority_ceremony_plan_verified_awaiting_separately_supplied_governance_and_live_decision
  + authority ceremony_plan_only fixture_only true
  + all nine external authorities unresolved and every effect false or zero
  + canonical compact duplicate-free bounded JSON with domain-separated self-digests
